{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212470","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212470","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1121247001:1":{"text":"난 새들이 눈을 뜰 때까지 기다렸어. 날이 밝을 때쯤이면 깨어날 거라고 생각했거든.","source_cn":"我一直在等它们睁开眼睛，我想等到天亮的时候，它们就会醒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F77A16460DDC9FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121247002:0":{"text":"하지만, 오늘은 해가 아주 늦게 떴어...","source_cn":"可是，今天的太阳，升起得好慢啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC0AFF736656E3BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121247003:0":{"text":"새들에게서 썩은 냄새가 나기 시작해서 일어나라고 깨웠는데, 소용이 없더라고.","source_cn":"我发现，它们的味道也变了，变得腥臭。我试着呼唤过它们，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1EAB043FD80886E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1121247003":{"text":"새들에게서 썩은 냄새가 나기 시작해서 일어나라고 깨웠는데, 소용이 없더라고.","source_cn":"我发现，它们的味道也变了，变得腥臭。我试着呼唤过它们，没有用。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1EAB043FD80886E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:5:1121247004:0":{"text":"즉시 묻어주지 않아 날씨의 영향으로 작은 새의 시체가 부패 되고 말았다...","source_cn":"由于没有及时埋葬，受天气影响，小鸟的尸体已经有些腐坏了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FFE37B398E2085A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121247005:0":{"text":"레미아와 그 남자아이가 날 속인 게 아니라, 엄마가 날 속인 거야.","source_cn":"蕾米雅和那个小男孩没有骗我，是妈妈骗了我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20728BC5EFA6F66D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121247006:0":{"text":"엄마, 저 사람들은 왜 저래요? 왜 움직이질 않는 거예요? 누가 그러는데, 저 사람들은 죽은 거래요.","source_cn":"妈妈，那些人怎么了？为什么一动不动？我听到有人说，他们死了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x255DECC501C5B6D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121247007:0":{"text":"딸아, 저 사람들은 지금 자고 있는 거란다.","source_cn":"傻孩子，他们是睡着了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBF8D22FE6C64EB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121247008:0":{"text":"그럼 언제 깨어나요?","source_cn":"什么时候会醒过来呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAFF5DB72DA4BEB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121247009:1":{"text":"음... 꿈이 끝나면 깨어날 거야.","source_cn":"等他们做完美梦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7321A9FC4D9A93D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1121247010:0":{"text":"죽음은 고요하고, 차갑고, 썩은 내가 나. 여러 가지 안 좋은 모습으로 변하게 되고...","source_cn":"死亡，会沉默、会冰冷、会腥臭，会变成各种糟糕的模样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3278BF31295B864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1121247011:0":{"text":"결국... 깨어나지도 못해.","source_cn":"唯独……不会醒来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69B2EC493A719C83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121247012:0":{"text":"예전에 나는 나쁜 짓을 너무 많이 저질렀어!","source_cn":"以前的我，做了很坏很坏的事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x180B1B05FB05555A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1121247012":{"text":"예전에 나는 나쁜 짓을 너무 많이 저질렀어!","source_cn":"以前的我，做了很坏很坏的事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x180B1B05FB05555A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1121247013:0":{"text":"난 위로 받을만한 사람이 아니야... 하지만 따뜻하게 대해줘서 고마워.","source_cn":"我不值得受到安慰……但是，谢谢你，你是一个温柔的人。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x70D5E609409D6ECA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"난 위로 받을만한 사람이 아니야... 하지만 따뜻하게 대해줘서 고마워.","female":"난 위로 받을만한 사람이 아니야... 하지만 따뜻하게 대해줘서 고마워.","variant_male_record_index":"118903","variant_female_record_index":"118904","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121247015:0":{"text":"이 새들은 어떡하지? 여기에 두고 싶지 않은데.","source_cn":"这些小鸟，我应该怎么办？我不希望它们被放在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D45F8F0CCDA7E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1121247015":{"text":"이 새들은 어떡하지? 여기에 두고 싶지 않은데.","source_cn":"这些小鸟，我应该怎么办？我不希望它们被放在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D45F8F0CCDA7E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1121247016:0":{"text":"여기 숲에서 믿는 신이 있다고 들었어. 마을에도 그 신의 작은 제단이 있더라고.","source_cn":"听说，这片丛林有自己信奉的神明，村子里就有那位神明的小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x397724881F2D5C0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1121247017:0":{"text":"새들을 그 근처에 묻어주고 싶어. 날 그곳으로 데려다 줄 수 있어? 부탁이야.","source_cn":"我想把小鸟埋葬在那附近。你能为我带路吗？拜托了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDAEBDF34C96550BF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"새들을 그 근처에 묻어주고 싶어. 날 그곳으로 데려다 줄 수 있어? 부탁이야.","female":"새들을 그 근처에 묻어주고 싶어. 날 그곳으로 데려다 줄 수 있어? 부탁이야.","variant_male_record_index":"118908","variant_female_record_index":"118909","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:0:1":{"text":"땅에 묻어주자","source_cn":"将它们埋葬吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4E2F033048C9A563","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"땅에 묻어주자","female":"땅에 묻어주자","variant_male_record_index":"63288",